t rather than a bike fault\"}, {\"text\": \"E2 is a jammed locking pin.\", \"line\": 10, \"span\": \"E2 is a jammed locking pin\"}, {\"text\": \"E4 is a loss of power to the point.\", \"line\": 10, \"span\": \"E4 is a loss of power to the point\"}, {\"text\": \"An E2 is raised to the field crew.\", \"line\": 15, \"span\": \"Raise an E2 to the field crew\"}, {\"text\": \"If the field crew have already tried 3 times, an E2 is raised to the workshop instead.\", \"line\": 15, \"span\": \"If the field crew have already tried 3 times,\\nraise it to the workshop instead\"}, {\"text\": \"An E4 is raised to the electrical contractor the same day.\", \"line\": 20, \"span\": \"Raise an E4 to the electrical contractor the same day\"}, {\"text\": \"A rider charged for a journey that ended at a faulted dock gets the journey refunded.\", \"line\": 24, \"span\": \"A rider charged for a journey that ended at a faulted dock gets the journey\\nrefunded\"}, {\"text\": \"The refund is given at the time of the call.\", \"line\": 25, \"span\": \"Refund at the time of the call\"}, {\"text\": \"The refund does not wait for the fault to be confirmed.\", \"line\": 25, \"span\": \"do not wait for the fault to be\\nconfirmed\"}, {\"text\": \"The support desk takes a station out of service in the app when more than half its docks are faulted.\", \"line\": 30, \"span\": \"The support desk takes a station out of service in the app when more than half\\nits docks are faulted\"}]}","ttft_ms":6809,"type":"result","duration_ms":6846,"uuid":"060a540e-5d18-4bfd-b3c3-2edc5a090786","ttft_stream_ms":2099,"time_to_request_ms":98,"first_content_frame_ms":2099,"queued_turn_count":0,"result_index":0}
